    description: "Discrete high-corpus-share slice of the WI-jusus var/field emission-parity umbrella. The PHP analyzer emits only file+class+method symbols — class-body typed PROPERTIES (private int $count;) and class CONSTANTS (const FOO = 1;) get no kind=field Symbol, so PHP class state is invisible to search/centrality/dead-code. Fix: emit kind=field for property_declaration + const_declaration in a class/interface/trait/enum body, anchored to the class (dotted name Class.prop); apply the register_symbol skip-set recipe (fields excluded from call-resolution so a data anchor never clobbers a same-named function) and a scope-walk guard so method-body locals do NOT leak as fields (the INV-lanaz/INV-sidab landmine — requires adversarial ground-truth review). Advances INV-jahiv. awaits_bakeoff_validation (corpus-wide symbol/centrality shift)."  # f10f
