  message: "DONE (merged 89778cc7df). PHP _extract_symbols now emits kind=field for property_declaration + const_declaration members anchored to the enclosing type (class/interface/trait/enum) and kind=variable for a top-level const. Per-element spans (public $a,$b -> 2 fields). No local-leak: property_declaration only occurs in a type body (method-body locals are assignment_expression), so INV-lanaz/INV-sidab does not apply. Dotted Type.member names stay out of the call-resolution registries. BEHAVIORAL: 3 tests (class prop+const, multi-prop, interface+enum const); php.py 100% cov; smart-test 3877 passed, no resolution regression. awaits_bakeoff_validation."  # 21f1
